    Rule #12 P3b SetStopLoss: single call before entry block,
             guarded by MarketPosition <= 0 (long variant).
    Rule #13 10-dim eval before live_simulation: deferred to W5 gate.
    Rule #14 OFFICIAL_ROADMAP alignment: S3_L is next per official sequence.

  LABEL CONVENTIONS (Long-only):
